---@field Catalog aws.partnercentral_selling.CatalogIdentifier Specifies the catalog associated with the engagement context request. This field takes a string value from a predefined list: AWS or Sandbox. The catalog determines which environment the engagement context is created in. Use AWS to create contexts in the production environment, and Sandbox for testing in secure, isolated environments.
