---@field ApnPrograms? aws.partnercentral_selling.ApnPrograms Specifies the Amazon Partner Network (APN) program that influenced the Opportunity. APN programs refer to specific partner programs or initiatives that can impact the Opportunity.
---@field CustomerBusinessProblem? aws.partnercentral_selling.PiiString|distilled.Secret Describes the problem the end customer has, and how the partner is helping. Utilize this field to provide a concise narrative that outlines the customer's business challenge or issue. Elaborate on how the partner's solution or offerings align to resolve the customer's business problem. Include relevant information about the partner's value proposition, unique selling points, and expertise to tackl...
