---Represents the request structure for starting a prospecting task. Includes up to 100 engagement identifiers and a task name. Uses ClientToken to ensure idempotency.
---@class aws.partnercentral_selling.StartProspectingFromEngagementTaskRequest
---@field Catalog aws.partnercentral_selling.CatalogIdentifier Specifies the catalog in which the task is initiated. Specify AWS for production environments and Sandbox for testing and development purposes.
---@field Identifiers aws.partnercentral_selling.EngagementIdentifierList The list of engagement identifiers to include in this prospecting task. Each identifier must correspond to an existing engagement in the specified catalog. Maximum of 100 identifiers per task.
---@field TaskName aws.partnercentral_selling.TaskName A descriptive name for the task. This name helps identify the task in list and get operations. The name must contain 1 to 128 characters.
---@field ClientToken aws.partnercentral_selling.ClientToken A unique, case-sensitive identifier provided by the client to ensure idempotency. Making the same request with the same ClientToken returns the same response without creating a duplicate task.

