---@field TaskId? aws.partnercentral_selling.ProspectingTaskIdentifier The unique identifier assigned to this task. Use this identifier with GetProspectingFromEngagementTask to retrieve task details and check status.
---@field TaskArn? aws.partnercentral_selling.ProspectingTaskArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the task. The ARN uniquely identifies the task across AWS and can be used for resource-level IAM policies.
---@field TaskStatus aws.partnercentral_selling.ProspectingTaskStatus The current status of the task. Possible values: PENDING (waiting to run), IN_PROGRESS (actively processing), COMPLETED (successfully processed), and FAILED (unrecoverable error).

