---@field OpportunityType? aws.partnercentral_selling.OpportunityType|string Specifies the opportunity type as a renewal, new, or expansion.
---@field Marketing? aws.partnercentral_selling.Marketing An object that contains marketing details for the Opportunity.
---@field SoftwareRevenue? aws.partnercentral_selling.SoftwareRevenue Specifies details of a customer's procurement terms. Required only for partners in eligible programs.
